<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.781 µm on a Holocene Canis lupus (MDCK) apical patch — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics, the Jacobian, and the Turing k_c formula are unchanged and still integrate on the periodic patch with a clip fraction of 0. Pass 2 adds the two controls the dispersion relation predicts: equal diffusion quenches (std 2.9e-15) and gamma=0 only diffuses the seed (std 6.9e-4) against a patterned std of 0.259. The 1 s time unit used to quote D_phys remains a reconstruction." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.781 µm on a Holocene Canis lupus (MDCK) apical patch — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
